<%# "Add by link" (4e; 1.5d, 4a), in the Roles page's toolbar and on a company's page (`company`, filled in): the role's
    link, and the rest under "More" when it helps. Tracked; checked right after when that is free, and never a check
    that could spend unasked: its page says what it could cost, with Check now. %>
<%= form_with url: roles_path, class: "add-link", "aria-label": "Add a role by its link" do |form| %>
  <%= hidden_field_tag :company_id, company.id if company %>
  <%= form.text_field :link, required: true, "aria-label": "The role's link", autocomplete: "off", value: flash[:link],
                             placeholder: company ? "Its page at #{company.name}, or its ATS posting" : "Paste a role's link" %>
  <%= form.submit company ? "Add" : "Add by link", class: "btn primary" %>
  <details class="add-more" data-controller="menu">
    <summary class="btn">More</summary>
    <div class="add-form">
      <label>
        <span>Title <span class="muted">(read from its page when left out)</span></span>
        <%= form.text_field :title, placeholder: "Solutions Engineer" %>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>Location <span class="muted">(optional)</span></span>
        <%= form.text_field :location, placeholder: "São Paulo, Brazil" %>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>Where you found it <span class="muted">(optional)</span></span>
        <%= form.text_field :source, placeholder: "linkedin.com/jobs/view/…" %>
      </label>
      <% unless company %>
        <label>
          <span>Company website <span class="muted">(optional: an ATS link doesn't name it)</span></span>
          <%= form.text_field :website, placeholder: "acme.com" %>
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>Company name <span class="muted">(optional, if new)</span></span>
          <%= form.text_field :company_name, placeholder: "Acme" %>
        </label>
      <% end %>
      <p class="muted small">
        Tracked: pasting a role is choosing it, even one you archived. A link on an ATS board (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby,
        Workday, Oracle) has the board watched at once, read free. The role is checked right after when that costs nothing;
        otherwise Check now, on its page, says what it could cost first. A careers-page link with <code>gh_jid</code> or
        <code>ashby_jid</code> is added as that posting once the board is on record. LinkedIn and other job boards are
        never read: put their link in "Where you found it".
      </p>
    </div>
  </details>
<% end %>
